                        A complex, smooth full bodied red wine with plenty of ripe,
                        velvety tannins and a very pleasant, long lingering finish.
                      </span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <span class="package-wine-name">1919 D.O.K</span>
                      <span class="package-wine-meta">
                        Gellewza, Grenache, Shiraz &middot; Marsovin, Malta
                      </span>
                      <span class="package-wine-note">
